<title>POLAND: PBR AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>PBR AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.44 vs    0.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.50 vs    4.77</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  7.38 vs    8.52</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	14.25 vs   12.58</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					 20.02 vs   14.91</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   34.64 vs   25.10</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 61.97 vs   48.04</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     132.94 vs  102.07</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
